# The race's other keys (spec M5): pause.scenario's way into the race; TAB sliding the status bar
# away, F5 the shadows off and on, the car driven on (--drive) to the scene's pictures, F4 those
# off and on, TAB the status bar back and away again, then P pausing the game (its box in the
# middle of the wider view) and Enter going on. A shot every 100 ms; run with --no-ai --drive.
at 2000 key space
at 24000 shot idle
at 24500 key Return
at 25300 shot k01-return
at 25600 key Down
at 26200 shot k02-down
at 26500 key Return
